IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nccp-credit`

-- National Consumer Credit Protection Act 2009 (Cth), ss 6, 29, 32, 128-133, 133BE, 133CA, 180, s 5 definitions; Code ss 5, 7, 23A, 31A, 31B, 39B, 42 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_national-consumer-credit-protection-act-2009.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*): Chloe, 21, on a $70,000 graduate salary, gets a
-- credit card on 10 June 2024 (c043); Chloe and Liam settle a Byford house-and-land package with a mortgage on 15 May 2028
-- (c052); Jake, 24, takes two credit cards on 2 March 2031 (k048); takes "a $2,000 small-amount loan at the capped charges"
-- on 20 August 2032 (k049; the scenario's question list puts it as "$400 a month on $2,000"); and on 22 August 2036 a
-- friend's debt to an unlicensed lender is brought to his door as paint and glue (k063).
-- The scenarios give no card limits, loan amounts other than the $2,000, loan terms, assessment dates or repayment capacity;
-- the figures used for them below are the encoder's. What a consumer could repay within the ASIC period under s 160F is an
-- INPUT (the period is set by a legislative instrument not deposited).

`k063: the unlicensed lender to Jake's friend` MEANS Person WITH
    `is a credit provider under a credit contract` IS TRUE
    `carries on a business of providing credit to which the Code applies` IS TRUE
    `exercises the rights of a credit provider, for itself or on its behalf` IS FALSE
    `holds a licence authorising the activity` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as employee, director or credit representative of a licensed principal` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as representative of a principal exempted under s 109 or s 110` IS FALSE

`k063: the man who glued the lock, collecting for that lender` MEANS Person WITH
    `is a credit provider under a credit contract` IS FALSE
    `carries on a business of providing credit to which the Code applies` IS FALSE
    `exercises the rights of a credit provider, for itself or on its behalf` IS TRUE
    `holds a licence authorising the activity` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as employee, director or credit representative of a licensed principal` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as representative of a principal exempted under s 109 or s 110` IS FALSE

`an employee of a licensed lender collecting within authority` MEANS Person WITH
    `is a credit provider under a credit contract` IS FALSE
    `carries on a business of providing credit to which the Code applies` IS FALSE
    `exercises the rights of a credit provider, for itself or on its behalf` IS TRUE
    `holds a licence authorising the activity` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as employee, director or credit representative of a licensed principal` IS TRUE
    `acts within authority as representative of a principal exempted under s 109 or s 110` IS FALSE

`a friend who lends without charge and not in business` MEANS Person WITH
    `is a credit provider under a credit contract` IS FALSE
    `carries on a business of providing credit to which the Code applies` IS FALSE
    `exercises the rights of a credit provider, for itself or on its behalf` IS FALSE
    `holds a licence authorising the activity` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as employee, director or credit representative of a licensed principal` IS FALSE
    `acts within authority as representative of a principal exempted under s 109 or s 110` IS FALSE

`k063: the friend applies on 1 March 2037` MEANS `Application for orders` WITH
    `the defendant engaged in a credit activity in relation to the applicant's side` IS TRUE
    `the activity contravened s 29, s 124A or s 133CA` IS TRUE
    `made by the plaintiff` IS TRUE
    `made by ASIC with the plaintiff's prior written consent` IS FALSE
    `cause of action accrued on` IS 20360822
    `made on` IS 20370301

`k063: Jake's household applies, not being the borrower` MEANS `Application for orders` WITH
    `the defendant engaged in a credit activity in relation to the applicant's side` IS FALSE
    `the activity contravened s 29, s 124A or s 133CA` IS TRUE
    `made by the plaintiff` IS TRUE
    `made by ASIC with the plaintiff's prior written consent` IS FALSE
    `cause of action accrued on` IS 20360822
    `made on` IS 20370301

`k063: the friend applies on the sixth anniversary` MEANS `Application for orders` WITH
    `the defendant engaged in a credit activity in relation to the applicant's side` IS TRUE
    `the activity contravened s 29, s 124A or s 133CA` IS TRUE
    `made by the plaintiff` IS TRUE
    `made by ASIC with the plaintiff's prior written consent` IS FALSE
    `cause of action accrued on` IS 20360822
    `made on` IS 20420822

`c052: Chloe and Liam's home loan, 500000 to buy the home they will live in` MEANS Credit WITH
