    `amount of credit` IS 500000
    `amount for personal, domestic or household purposes or residential investment property` IS 500000
    `a charge is or may be made` IS TRUE
    `provided in the course of a business` IS TRUE

`a loan to Jake's delivery business, half of it for personal use` MEANS Credit WITH
